n></div><div class=\"label-outer\" data-v-0fbb5f67><div class=\"label-container\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"label-wrap\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-0fbb5f67>Back to News</span></span></div></div></a><span data-component=\"tag\" data-force-active=\"false\" class=\"span-tag\" data-v-4490f3fb data-v-a9cd5498><span class=\"label-container\" data-v-a9cd5498><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium label\" data-v-a9cd5498>Community</span></span></span><h1 class=\"header-title xxl-18 xl-18 lg-20 md-22 sm-12 xs-14 -mix-title-3\" data-v-4490f3fb>Delta Cafés and Clube Português de Colecionadores de Pacotes de Açúcar promote a collectors’ meeting in Campo Maior</h1><h2 class=\"header-info\" data-v-4490f3fb><span class=\"-mix-text-2-regular\" data-v-4490f3fb>Posted</span><time class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" datetime=\"2025-02-28\" data-v-4490f3fb>2025-02-28</time><svg class=\"em-dash\" width=\"16\" height=\"3\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 3\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-v-4490f3fb><path d=\"M0.152344 0.820007H15.8483V2.18001H0.152344V0.820007Z\" fill=\"#35221A\" data-v-4490f3fb></path></svg><span class=\"-mix-text-2-regular\" data-v-4490f3fb>Time to Read</span><span class=\"-sans-text-3-medium\" data-v-4490f3fb>1m </span></h2><figure data-component=\"figure\" style=\"--width:500px;--width-rs:max(68.0000px, calc(-60.6107px + 32.9771vw));\" class=\"left header-figure\" data-v-4490f3fb data-v-aa0c7ef8><img width=\"1000\" height=\"1178\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" data-nuxt-img onerror=\"this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)\" data-component=\"image-asset\" alt=\"Image\" fetchpriority data-v-aa0c7ef8 src=\"/assets/images/93f2534e7bacff88ce0b6da02626788f6d92c7a3-1000x1178-fa5fc26572.jpg\"></figure></div></div><main data-v-84023241><div data-component=\"article-body\" data-v-84023241 data-v-9d6634a8><div class=\"article-body align-center\" data-v-9d6634a8><div class=\"article-content\" data-v-9d6634a8><h4>On International Women’s Day, celebrated on 8 March, Delta Cafés and Clube Português de Colecionadores de Pacotes de Açúcar (CLUPAC) are hosting a collectors’ meeting at Quinta das Argamassas, in Campo Maior. The event honours the women of Alentejo, of Portugal, and of the world. It encourages the exchange of collectible items among participants and promotes fellowship and collecting in the region.</h4><p>The meeting starts at 9:00 and runs until 12:30, including a visit to several collectors’ exhibitions. In the afternoon, participants also have the opportunity to visit the Centro de Ciência do Café and Adega Mayor, the first signature winery in Portugal, designed by the architect Siza Vieira.</p><p>To mark this day, a new special edition of sugar packets was also produced and offered to participants, paying tribute to the Women of Alentejo, of Portugal, and of the World, and highlighting twelve women who stood out in a wide range of fields at regional, national, and international level.</p><h2></h2><h2></h2></div></div></div><section data-component=\"related-articles\" class=\"g-row align-center\" data-v-84023241 data-v-d3cf5684><div class=\"xxl-32 g-col sm-14\" data-v-d3cf5684><div class=\"title-container\" data-v-d3cf5684><div data-component=\"font-pairing-title\" class=\"title-2 -uppercase title\" data-v-d3cf5684 data-v-b55614a0><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-b55614a0><span>Others</span><span>Articles <em>For</em> You</span></h2></div><a href=\"/jornal\" class=\"\" data-size=\"small\" data-component=\"button\" aria-label=\"Back to News\" data-v-d3cf5684 data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"bg full\" data-v-0fbb5f67></span><div class=\"icon-wrapper arrow-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67><span class=\"icon-container arrow-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67><div data-component=\"icon\" class=\"xsmaller arrow-right\" data-v-0fbb5f67 data-v-8c9deb48><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" data-v-8c9deb48><path fill=\"#35221A\" d=\"m11.09 3.3 5.333 6.133-5.307 6.16 1.04 1.04 7.306-7.2-7.33